</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, Thou art with me,</l><l>And Thou dost give</l><l>Strength for the journey,</l><l>Grace now to live.</l><l>Mercies each morning</l><l>Thou dost renew;</l><l>And for my prospect,</l><l>Thy rest in view.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, Thou art with me;</l><l>Onward:I move;</l><l>Each day I’m proving</l><l>More of Thy love.</l><l>Now Thou art training,</l><l>Setting me free</l><l>From all that hinders,</l><l>To dwell with Thee.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
